  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgextgiCrOYqbmv7oX0Lf4OU6SD77vUvCiGk3k_RUnGdUHi_WgMiQoHSYLyh-apAYCObsNC9dKegi6ntFDIyg8i99VpXbire-gomAUHPFwRSgbvHalIikNHGx9I1ul7QeUkxlUww4O-BnB8Z8zVbQc4LaEay07AMIcxirPIizyrY2-yFL89PsrKa6u7oHA/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-12-02T194823.455.jpeg\"><img alt=\"דמות מצוירת של תלמיד הצועד לאחור עם ילקוט גב\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgextgiCrOYqbmv7oX0Lf4OU6SD77vUvCiGk3k_RUnGdUHi_WgMiQoHSYLyh-apAYCObsNC9dKegi6ntFDIyg8i99VpXbire-gomAUHPFwRSgbvHalIikNHGx9I1ul7QeUkxlUww4O-BnB8Z8zVbQc4LaEay07AMIcxirPIizyrY2-yFL89PsrKa6u7oHA/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-12-02T194823.455.jpeg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">אִחוּר - אָחוֹר - אַחֵר</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עִם לָבָן גַּרְתִּי וָאֵחַר עַד עָתָּה</span></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בואו ונעיף מבט על הַשֹּׁרֶשׁ&nbsp;א.ח.ר</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">⌚</span>בפסוק שבכותרת, משמשת המילה כביטוי <b>לְאִחוּר&nbsp;</b>בזמן (התאחרתי).</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">➕</span>בפסוק \"<span style=\"background-color: white; text-align: -webkit-center;\">יֹסֵף</span><span style=\"background-color: white; text-align: -webkit-center;\">&nbsp;ה' לִי בֵּן אַחֵר</span>\", משמשת המילה לציון <b>תּוֹסֶפֶת</b>/<b>שׁוֹנוּת</b>&nbsp;(עוד בן מלבד זה הקיים).</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔙</span>בפסוק \"הַנֹּשֵׁךְ עִקְּבֵי סוּס וַיִּפֹּל רֹכְבוֹ אָחוֹר\", משמשת המילה לציון <b>כִּוּוּן </b>(הפוך מהצד הַקִּדְמִי).</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הכיצד?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ובכן, המכנה המשותף לכולם,&nbsp;הנו:</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></span></p><blockquote><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שלילה של דבר סמוך (מבחינה פיסית או רעיונית), וחיוב של דבר מרוחק</span></span></blockquote><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">⌚</span></span><b style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִחוּר</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">,</span><b style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אַחֲרִית</b><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">,</span><b style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b>אַחֲרֵי</b>, <b>אַחֲרוֹן</b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;- לא ה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זמן</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;הקרוב, אלא הרחוק.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">➕</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><b>אַחֵר</b>&nbsp;- לא (רק) האובייקט הסמוך/הידוע, אלא משהו (נוסף) שונה</span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🔙<b>אָחוֹר</b> - לא הצד/הכיוון הָאִינְטוּאִיטִיבִי (קדימה), אלא הפחות צפוי (אחורה).</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">באופן דומה, נפענח מילים נוספות מאותה משפחה:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">❓</span><span style=\"background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial;\"><b>מֵאַחַר</b></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><b>&nbsp;שֶׁ</b>&nbsp;👈 בגלל הדבר הזה (הקרוב/המובן/הראשוני) - יתרחש דבר אחר/שונה (פחות צפוי)</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">📆</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>מָחָר</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: white;\">👈</span>&nbsp;לא ביום הזה (הנוכחי/הקרוב) - אלא המרוחק יותר.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🌱</span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b>יִחוּר</b> <span style=\"background-color: white; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">👈</span> ענף שנוטלים מהעץ הקיים (כאן) - כדי שיגדל לעץ אחר (שם).</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🚰<b>עָכוּר</b> <span style=\"background-color: white; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">👈</span> שינוי המראה/התדמית הנאה המוכר/ת - למשהו פחות רצוי.\nבהחלפת האותיות הגרוניות א-ע (כמו גמא-גמע), ובהחלפת ח-כ (כמו אנוכי-אנחנו)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">📃</span><b style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אַחְרָיוּת</b><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> <span style=\"background-color: white; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">👈</span> התחייבות/התנהגות בהווה - שיש לה השפעה על העתיד המאוחר (מֵעֵבֶר לַמִּיָּדִי).</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🧱</span><b style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אָרִיחַ</b><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> <span style=\"background-color: white; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">👈</span> (בלשוננו: משטח ריצוף. בלשון המשנה: חֲצִי לְבֵנָה). ביחס לכל חצי - יש גם חצי אחר. </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אבל,\n</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">❌</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אין קשר למילה תחרות. מקורה במילה חֹם</span>&nbsp;(</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">חֳרִי) הנובע ממאמץ התחרות. </span></span></p><br />"
}
